NOTICE
======

pi-sock is derived from the session control extension in
https://github.com/mitsuhiko/agent-stuff (npm: mitsupi),
`extensions/control.ts` by Armin Ronacher, licensed under the MIT license.

Substantial portions of the socket server, message injection, and message
extraction logic in index.ts are retained from that file. It has been trimmed of
multi-session discovery, alias handling, CLI startup flags, the send_to_session
tools, session rewind, and LLM summarization, and adapted with persistent
multi-event subscriptions, get_state, and pi.sendUserMessage-based injection.

